      <p begin="00:03.470" end="00:11.470" ttm:agent="v1">Ah-huh, ah-huh, ah-huh</p>
      <p begin="00:13.180" end="00:14.680" ttm:agent="v1">One, two, three</p>
      <p begin="00:14.110" end="00:18.970" ttm:agent="v1">We on go, we on go, we on go, we on go-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="00:18.970" end="00:22.110" ttm:agent="v1">Let 'em know, let 'em know, let 'em know-ow-ow-ow</p>
      <p begin="00:22.110" end="00:26.060" ttm:agent="v1">We on go, we on go, we on go-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="00:26.060" end="00:28.740" ttm:agent="v1">Let 'em know, let 'em know, let 'em know-ow-ow-ow</p>
      <p begin="00:28.740" end="00:31.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Uh, NBA block 'em outta the phone (the phone)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.260" end="00:32.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm breakin' hearts and I put 'em in Chrome (in Chrome)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.780" end="00:36.480" ttm:agent="v1">Swipe it, no swipin', these bitches be stealin' my tunes</p>
      <p begin="00:36.480" end="00:40.440" ttm:agent="v1">Stealin' the charts, type of shit that I'm on, I might go fence in skeleton bone</p>
      <p begin="00:40.440" end="00:44.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You know a bitch like me, get cold, brrt, icin' out everything I own (huh)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.070" end="00:45.780" ttm:agent="v1">Came from the bottom to bottom</p>
      <p begin="00:45.780" end="00:47.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I brought my twin with me, just like feel the lion (the lion)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.780" end="00:51.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">These the hos watch me on replay, on replay and replay just like it's a reel (like it's a reel)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.040" end="00:54.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You know I stay real (real), I give a fuck how you feel (feel)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.940" end="00:58.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I might go yellow or black on Margella, I cut through the paper, I'm killin' the Bill (rrr)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.480" end="01:02.660" ttm:agent="v1">We on go, we on go, we on go, we on go-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="01:02.660" end="01:05.930" ttm:agent="v1">Let 'em know, let 'em know, let 'em know-ow-ow-ow</p>
      <p begin="01:05.930" end="01:09.980" ttm:agent="v1">We on go, we on go, we on go-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="01:09.980" end="01:13.220" ttm:agent="v1">Let 'em know, let 'em know, let 'em know-ow-ow-ow</p>
      <p begin="01:13.220" end="01:20.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Whoa, whoa, whoa (ah-huh), whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa</p>
      <p begin="01:20.170" end="01:27.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa (ah-huh), whoa, whoa, whoa, wo-o-o-ow</p>
      <p begin="01:27.300" end="01:31.270" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, I give a fuck 'bout your status, lil' ho, see me in person, she stuck like a post</p>
      <p begin="01:31.270" end="01:34.930" ttm:agent="v1">Sit in the corner, I'm pullin' my blunt 'cause I heard these lil' bitches out, you wanna smoke</p>
      <p begin="01:34.930" end="01:38.660" ttm:agent="v1">When you start earnin', they be like gimmick, when it start turnin', just like they timid</p>
      <p begin="01:38.660" end="01:42.360" ttm:agent="v1">Which y'all mad at before, why? 'Cause I'm pullin' these things like Lenny</p>
      <p begin="01:42.360" end="01:45.910" ttm:agent="v1">Rock out, as soon as I get on the stage, open it up, we 'bout to rage</p>
      <p begin="01:45.910" end="01:49.600" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, can't be my equal, girl, we not the same</p>
      <p begin="01:49.600" end="01:53.130" ttm:agent="v1">Everything pretty, I do what I do, self-esteem, drop when I step in a room</p>
      <p begin="01:53.130" end="01:55.920" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, why I said that? I know that wasn't cool, fuck it</p>
